luding fertile plains, subalpine forested hills, and eight of the world's ten highest mountains, including Mount Everest, the highest point above mean sea level on Earth. Kathmandu is the nation's capital and its largest city. Nepal is a multi-ethnic, multi-lingual, multi-religious, and multi-cultural sovereign state, with Nepali as the official language.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nepal","source":"Wikipedia","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","iso2":"NP"}],"arc":{"reports":37,"first_seen":"2026-09-06T19:16:19Z","first_title":"Nepal rescuers continue search for missing as identification of dead remains challenge","first_url":"https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/news/international/world-news/nepal-rescuers-continue-search-for-missing-as-identification-of-dead-remains-challenge/articleshow/133849891.cms","first_publisher":"The Economic Times","earlier":[{"id":"e_4b03e0935b9c","title":"Villages evacuated as flash flood from Budhi Gandaki River hits northern Nepal","date":"2026-10-15T15:33:19Z","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","publisher":"New Castle News","verification":"single_source_report"},{"id":"e_64ceb4e8ab57","title":"Nepal’s devastating flood exposes the risks of resettling disaster survivors","date":"2026-10-16T04:16:00Z","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","publisher":"KTVN","verification":"multi_source_reporting"},{"id":"e_3352a6e2d3cf","title":"Shelter and winter kits urgent for Nepal's flood affected communities","date":"2026-10-16T08:05:42Z","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxPRzRkeVNXcnBaNmJhX25hR0ZBNXNuWW02VVBGaVVYZDRpb2VXQUZaSU14NVpJeXVFenA1ODkxRmplQWxQaFlVLUd0OHBRZVBjMnAyV1J4bXMtRnlzQzJna2Y4YkR1YThjdjVTUjE1ZERmZnZad2N3ZlM0RlRyTU5JYXE3TTNkc0tXLUdlSVRLNWZ0TEZmVGFwcG5FYw?oc=5","publisher":"The Lutheran World Federation","verification":"single_source_report"},{"id":"e_053db58a514f","title":"Flash floods destroy villages in central Nepal","date":"2026-10-16T10:12:48Z","url":"https://www.theguardian.com/environment/2026/oct/16/flash